From 708891dabe5d4f37c76a0de63dc353cdf05902b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: YeonGyu-Kim <code.yeon.gyu@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Apr 2026 16:17:44 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 4527/5749] test: fix stale expectations after gpt-5.5 model
 promotion

Updates test expectations across agent, cli, shared, plugin, and tools tests

to match gpt-5.5 as the new default for oracle, hephaestus, and deep agents.

Includes snapshot updates for model-fallback tests.

Ultraworked with [Sisyphus](https://github.com/code-yeongyu/oh-my-openagent)

Co-authored-by: Sisyphus <clio-agent@sisyphuslabs.ai>
